<div id="p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">PVLDB Artifact Availability:
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The source code, data, and/or other artifacts have been made available at </span><a href="https://github.com/LeonLee666/IObench4DiskANN" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">https://github.com/LeonLee666/IObench4DiskANN</a><span id="p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span><span id="p2.1.4" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
